In <imath>\triangle ABC</imath>, <imath>AB=BC=29</imath>, and <imath>AC=42</imath>. What is the area of <imath>\triangle ABC</imath>?

<imath>\textbf{(A) }100\qquad\textbf{(B) }420\qquad\textbf{(C) }500\qquad\textbf{(D) }609\qquad \textbf{(E) }701</imath>

